          Linux gets an AppImage, and with it the automatic updates the other platforms
          already had. The launcher icon is fixed: the desktop entry named an icon that was
          never installed, so Linux showed a placeholder.
        </p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="1.12.1" date="2026-09-12">
      <description>
        <p>A connection set not to save query results still shows them while the app is open.</p>
      </description>
    </release>
  </releases>
</component>
